# Purple project conventions

Purple is an AI-powered health journal (epilepsy and pattern-driven conditions) built with TanStack Start (React 19), Vite 7, Tailwind 4, Supabase, and Stripe, deployed to Cloudflare Workers. Brand domain: `https://www.purplelife.org`.

## Agent operations

Operational work (Doppler, Supabase API, wrangler, git, native CLI) is agent-owned. See `.cursor/rules/no-manual-operator-work.mdc`.

**Session start:** read `docs/HANDOFF.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, `docs/OPEN-ISSUES.md`, `docs/LEARNINGS.md` (`.cursor/rules/compounding-memory.mdc`).
**Task done:** append log to `docs/HANDOFF.md` before claiming complete; also sync `CURSOR_HANDOFF.md` per `post-task-documentation.mdc`.

## Runtime and commands

- Package manager and runtime is **bun**. Never assume `npm test`. The real commands live in `package.json`:
  - `bun run dev` (port 8080), `bun run build`, `bun run lint`, `bun run format`
  - `bun run test:e2e` (Playwright, `tests/e2e/`), `bun run test:e2e:install` first on fresh machines
  - Quality gates: `bun run check:em-dash`, `bun run check:live-data`, `bun run check:unique-images`
- `bun run build` runs `scripts/check-no-em-dash.mjs` as a prebuild gate.

## Hard constraints (CI-enforced)

- **No em dashes (U+2014) anywhere** in `src/` or `public/`. Use a comma, hyphen, "and", "or", or rewrite. See `mem/constraint/no-em-dash.md`.
- **No placeholder or test data** in marketing pages or seeds (`scripts/check-no-test-data.mjs`).
- **Each marketing route uses a unique hero image** (`scripts/check-unique-route-images.mjs`).

## Code style

- Imports at the top of the module only. No inline imports in function bodies, except the established pattern where `*.functions.ts` dynamically imports its sibling `*.server.ts` to keep secrets out of the client bundle.
- Path alias `@/` maps to `src/`.
- shadcn/ui components live in `src/components/ui/` and `src/components/ui-oura/`. Do not hand-roll primitives that already exist there.
- i18n: user-facing strings in app routes go through `react-i18next` (`src/i18n/locales/en.json`, `es.json`). SSR always renders `en`; `hydrateLocale()` runs post-hydration in `__root.tsx`.
- Currency display goes through a shared formatter, never hardcode currency symbols.

## Data safety

- All SQL in migrations and seeds is reviewed against the live schema before code that depends on it ships (`docs/manual-deploy-bundle.md` documents the manual deploy path when the Supabase CLI 403s).
- Health data is sensitive. Any new table needs RLS policies in the same migration. Caregiver access is scope-checked through `src/lib/care.scopes.ts`, never raw user_id equality for shared data.
- Cross-user access failures return 404, not 403.

## Memory folder

`mem/` holds durable decisions: `mem/index.md` is the index. Read it before changing footer layout, metric naming, or punctuation conventions. Add a new `mem/` note when a non-obvious decision is made. After every task, follow `.cursor/rules/post-task-documentation.mdc` to sync handoff and docs.
